<p>You transform into pure lightning, moving <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">470%, 551%, 622%, 688%, 750%</acronym> faster for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> game turns.</p><p>Also provides 30% physical damage resistance and 100% lightning resistance.</p><p>Any actions other than moving will stop this effect.</p><p>Note: since you will be moving very fast, game turns will pass very slowly.</p><p>Levels in Lightning Speed additionally raises your Movement Speed by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8%, 17%, 25%, 33%, 40%,</acronym> passively.</p><p>Each point in storm drake talents also increases your lightning resistance by 1%.</p>